# Viewer/app state is not knowledge — keep the repo program-agnostic
.obsidian/
/logseq/
.trash/

# Derived artifacts — never committed. links.json: the mechanical index,
# rebuilt by `graph.py check` after edits (rule 7), pulls (SYNC ritual), and
# clones (SETUP smoke test). presentations/<yyyy-mm-dd>-<slug>/: agent-rendered
# outputs (reports, HTML, PDF) — disposable renderings of the graph; external
# backups cover keepers, and insights are distilled back into pages/ first.
_generated/

# Dump-zone contents — transient by contract (drained on ingestion) and may
# hold huge binary blobs; disk backups cover the window until ingestion.
# Only the contract README ships.
raw/*
!raw/README.md

# Binary store — durable but never in git (binaries don't diff or merge, only
# bloat append-only history; disk backups are their durability). Git tracks
# text; textual verbatim originals live tracked in archive/ instead.
assets/*
!assets/README.md

# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
